    "autoPhases": [],
    "notes": [
      "Cold start: throttle open 1/8 inch; fuel primer 2-6 strokes & locked (none if warm).",
      "Flooded start: throttle HALF FULL (be ready to reduce on start); as engine starts advance mixture to 2/3 then full rich; a throttle bump may help.",
      "Ignition: 10 s max crank, 20 s cooldown between attempts."
